message: "If you use this specification, please cite it as below."
title: "Royalty OS v0.2: Event-Based Trace-to-Value Circulation Architecture"
version: "0.2.0-draft"
date-released: "2026-06-04"
type: software
license: MIT

authors:

* name: "SamuraiWriter7"

repository-code: "https://github.com/SamuraiWriter7/royalty-os-v0.2"

abstract: >
Royalty OS v0.2 is an experimental event-based architecture for connecting
traceable human-originated thought to dynamic value circulation. It extends
the static Royalty OS v0.1 recognition model into an append-only value event
log with modular schemas, AI-assisted detection, human review, dynamic value
signals, allocation decisions, and return history. This draft defines the
initial architecture, event model, review layer, allocation layer, modular
JSON Schemas, YAML examples, validation script, and automated GitHub Actions
workflow for Royalty OS v0.2.

